If you entered Explore mode after the game started (and thus did not
start with the wand of wishing), then there is absolutely no 'taint' to
your game.  The only actual differences between your game and a 'normal'
one are that you will be asked whether you want to die or not, and your
game will not go into the 'record' file.

As long as you don't answer "yes" to the question Die (yn)?, then your
game will remain untainted and perfectly valid.

